 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "files is a list of [name, lines] pairs (lines is a list of strings); word is a non-empty string of ASCII letters and digits. A token is a maximal run of ASCII letters and digits inside a line; an occurrence is a token equal to word when ASCII letter case is ignored. For each file, in input order, that has at least one occurrence, output the row [name, total occurrence count in the file as a decimal string, then every line with at least one occurrence, verbatim, in line order, each listed once]. Files without occurrences are omitted. Return the list of rows.",
